{
  "method": "recognizer_word_times",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "start": 0.7,
      "end": 2.45,
      "text": "A thin curl of smoke",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "start": 2.49,
      "end": 4.52,
      "text": "rises off the Panhandle grass.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 5.95,
      "text": "Up on a tower,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "start": 5.99,
      "end": 8.64,
      "text": "two cameras turn and lock onto it.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "start": 9.18,
      "end": 11.3,
      "text": "There is a reason they are up there.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "start": 11.56,
      "end": 13.37,
      "text": "The Smokehouse Creek fire",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "start": 13.41,
      "end": 15.51,
      "text": "started in Hutchinson County near",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "start": 15.55,
      "end": 17.18,
      "text": "Stinnett and became the",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "start": 17.22,
      "end": 19.52,
      "text": "largest wildfire in state history.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10",
      "start": 19.94,
      "end": 25.52,
      "text": "It burned roughly 1,058,482 acres.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11",
      "start": 26.24,
      "end": 28.31,
      "text": "Xcel Energy said its facilities",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c12",
      "start": 28.35,
      "end": 30.1,
      "text": "appeared to have been involved.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c13",
      "start": 30.48,
      "end": 32.2,
      "text": "So Xcel teamed up with",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c14",
      "start": 32.24,
      "end": 34.14,
      "text": "a company called Pano AI.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c15",
      "start": 34.56,
      "end": 35.9,
      "text": "By last November,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c16",
      "start": 35.94,
      "end": 37.61,
      "text": "there were 57 camera",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c17",
      "start": 37.65,
      "end": 39.3,
      "text": "stations across the Panhandle,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c18",
      "start": 39.52,
      "end": 42.0,
      "text": "each on top of a communication tower.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19",
      "start": 42.52,
      "end": 44.24,
      "text": "Each station sweeps a",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20",
      "start": 44.28,
      "end": 47.02,
      "text": "full 360 degrees every minute.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c21",
      "start": 47.1,
      "end": 50.16,
      "text": "It watches about 10 miles in each direction.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c22",
      "start": 50.44,
      "end": 53.08,
      "text": "Its AI is hunting one thing.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23",
      "start": 53.36,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "Smoke.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c24",
      "start": 54.28,
      "end": 57.4,
      "text": "When it finds a grey smudge on the horizon,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c25",
      "start": 57.44,
      "end": 58.68,
      "text": "it flags it.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c26",
      "start": 58.74,
      "end": 60.88,
      "text": "A flag is not a fire, though.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c27",
      "start": 61.02,
      "end": 63.5,
      "text": "So a human analyst checks it first.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c28",
      "start": 64.1,
      "end": 65.83,
      "text": "Then a second tower turns",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c29",
      "start": 65.87,
      "end": 67.44,
      "text": "its eyes the same way.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c30",
      "start": 67.6,
      "end": 69.6,
      "text": "Where the two sightlines cross,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c31",
      "start": 69.64,
      "end": 72.06,
      "text": "the map can get exact coordinates.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c32",
      "start": 72.53,
      "end": 74.28,
      "text": "Pano calls 911.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33",
      "start": 74.7,
      "end": 76.3,
      "text": "The closest fire department",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c34",
      "start": 76.34,
      "end": 77.52,
      "text": "gets the live stream,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c35",
      "start": 77.56,
      "end": 79.24,
      "text": "and a brush truck rolls.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c36",
      "start": 80.06,
      "end": 81.36,
      "text": "Here is the catch.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c37",
      "start": 81.97,
      "end": 84.97,
      "text": "Xcel's Reeves warns responders that a lot of",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c38",
      "start": 85.01,
      "end": 87.22,
      "text": "these alerts will turn out to be nothing.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39",
      "start": 87.64,
      "end": 89.94,
      "text": "Most people are okay with that, he says.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c40",
      "start": 89.98,
      "end": 92.66,
      "text": "They want to know everything that is going on.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c41",
      "start": 93.08,
      "end": 95.44,
      "text": "Some cameras look over towns, though.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c42",
      "start": 95.8,
      "end": 99.28,
      "text": "Those pixelate anything built, houses and all.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c43",
      "start": 100.06,
      "end": 101.98,
      "text": "Somebody pays for all of it.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c44",
      "start": 102.26,
      "end": 104.19,
      "text": "Xcel paid up front and will",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c45",
      "start": 104.23,
      "end": 106.48,
      "text": "ask regulators to recover that cost,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c46",
      "start": 106.64,
      "end": 108.67,
      "text": "and it planned 68 more",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c47",
      "start": 108.71,
      "end": 112.28,
      "text": "under a $490 million resiliency plan.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c48",
      "start": 112.7,
      "end": 114.58,
      "text": "None of it puts out a fire.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c49",
      "start": 114.76,
      "end": 116.49,
      "text": "It buys a head start,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c50",
      "start": 116.53,
      "end": 118.36,
      "text": "and then somebody still has",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c51",
      "start": 118.4,
      "end": 120.0,
      "text": "to drive toward the smoke.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    }
  ]
}
